fooyin is a music player built around customisation. It provides a
variety of widgets to help you manage and play your local collection.

It's highly extensible with a plugin system and includes FooScript, a
scripting language for advanced configuration of widgets. A layout
editing mode enables the entire user interface to be customised,
starting from a blank slate or a preset layout.

Optional dependencies (autodetected) are:
- KDSingleApplication - will use the bundled version if not found
- libebur128 - ReplayGain scanner plugin
- libgme - GME audio input plugin
- libopenmpt - OpenMPT audio input plugin
- soundtouch - SoundTouch DSP plugin
- soxr - SoX resampler DSP plugin
